review_comments_data.body:
(seem to have lost this comment)

@lilitkarapetyan - we're making these changes because a scientist wants to download the full history of activities for a wargame - not just the most recent one.  So, on the client we are building up an array of activities, and pushing them all to the server on `pingServer`.   That means `player-log` will grow to have all activites for all roles for all wargames.

That's a lot more data.  It also means that when we retrieve the player logs for a wargame, she server needs to only provide the most recent activity (newest `id`) for each role.

